on (along AE). Since it's 136\u00b0, and AB is straight, the turn is 180\u00b0 - 136\u00b0 = 44\u00b0 to the left (if we are going right, turning left 44\u00b0 to go along AE).\n\nThen at E, we turn 90\u00b0 to go along EC. Since the angle at E is 90\u00b0, and we are coming from AE, which is going down-left, to go along EC, which is going down-right, we turn 90\u00b0 to the right.\n\nSo the total turn from AB to CD is 44\u00b0 (left) + 90\u00b0 (right) = 46\u00b0 to the right.\n\nSince CD is horizontal, and we are going along EC, the angle between EC and CD is 46\u00b0.\n\nTherefore, angle C is 46\u00b0.\n\nAnother way: the angle between AE and the horizontal is 44\u00b0 (as calculated), and since AE and CE are perpendicular, the angle between CE and the horizontal is 90\u00b0 - 44\u00b0 = 46\u00b0.\n\nSo, angle C is 46\u00b0.\n\nFinal answer: C","n_input":197,"n_generated":1212,"seq_len":1409,"grid":[8,10],"img_span":[4,84],"user_text_span":[85,192],"answer_seg":[1210,1211],"ans_tp":[1406],"texts":["<|im_start|>","user","\n","<|vision_start|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_pad|>","<|image_p